<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>ELPISOUL PC 캐릭터 DB</title>
<style>
:root{
 --bg:#eef1f7; --panel:#ffffff; --panel2:#f8fafc; --text:#0f172a; --muted:#64748b;
 --line:#dbe3ef; --primary:#4f46e5; --primary2:#eef2ff; --good:#047857; --warn:#b45309; --bad:#b91c1c;
 --shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(15,23,42,.08); --radius:18px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html,body{height:100%}
body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f8ff 0,#eef1f7 34%,#e9edf5 100%);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Noto Sans KR","Apple SD Gothic Neo",sans-serif;color:var(--text);letter-spacing:-.025em}
button,input,select{font:inherit}
.app{min-height:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px minmax(760px,1fr);}
.sidebar{position:sticky;top:0;height:100vh;padding:22px 18px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-right:1px solid var(--line);overflow:auto}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:18px}.mark{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4f46e5,#9333ea);box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(79,70,229,.25)}
.logo h1{font-size:20px;line-height:1.15;margin:0}.logo small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;margin-top:3px}
.side-note{font-size:13px;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:12px;margin:10px 0 16px}
#pageDesc{white-space:pre-line}
.nav{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:16px 0}.nav button{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 13px;text-align:left;font-weight:900;color:#334155;cursor:pointer}.nav button.active{background:var(--primary);color:#fff;border-color:var(--primary)}
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.stat{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:12px}.stat b{font-size:24px}.stat span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:800;margin-top:3px}
.legend{display:grid;gap:8px;margin-top:16px}.legend h3{font-size:13px;margin:0;color:#334155}.legend-item{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:#475569}.dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:99px;background:#cbd5e1}.dot.ok{background:#22c55e}.dot.warn{background:#f97316}.dot.bad{background:#ef4444}.dot.mid{background:#6366f1}
.main{padding:22px 24px 48px;min-width:0}.topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:16px}.topbar h2{font-size:32px;margin:0}.topbar p{margin:5px 0 0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.update-stamp{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:8px!important;padding:6px 10px;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:999px;background:#eff6ff;color:#1d4ed8!important;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.update-stamp a{color:#4338ca;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.release-check{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:9px 12px;font-weight:900;color:#334155}.release-check input{width:16px;height:16px}.btn{border:0;background:#0f172a;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.btn.secondary{background:#fff;color:#0f172a;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.workspace{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 390px;gap:18px;align-items:start}.workspace.detail-collapsed{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 58px}.leftcol{min-width:0}.panel{display:none}.panel.active{display:block}.toolbar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,300px) repeat(7,minmax(104px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.toolbar input,.toolbar select{width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:42px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;padding:0 10px;outline:none;font-size:14px}.toolbar input:focus,.toolbar select:focus{border-color:#a5b4fc;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #eef2ff}.table-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}.table-wrap{max-height:calc(100vh - 190px);overflow:auto}.data-table{border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;font-size:13.5px}.data-table th{position:sticky;top:0;background:#f8fafc;color:#334155;text-align:left;padding:12px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);z-index:1;white-space:nowrap}.data-table td{padding:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf2f7;vertical-align:top}.data-table tr{cursor:pointer}.data-table tr:hover{background:#f8fafc}.data-table tr.selected{background:#eef2ff}.namecell b{font-size:15px}.namecell span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:2px}.char-thumb{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#f8fafc);display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;color:#6366f1;font-weight:1000}.char-thumb img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.char-thumb span{width:100%;height:100%;display:none;place-items:center;font-size:16px}.detail-head-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:96px 1fr;gap:14px;align-items:center}.detail-portrait{width:96px;height:96px;border-radius:22px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eef2ff,#f8fafc);display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;color:#6366f1;font-weight:1000;font-size:28px}.detail-portrait img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.detail-portrait span{width:100%;height:100%;display:none;place-items:center}.image-path{margin-top:6px!important;font-size:11px!important;color:#94a3b8!important}.tags{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}.tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 7px;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;background:#f1f5f9;color:#475569;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;white-space:nowrap}.tag.ok{background:#dcfce7;color:#166534;border-color:#bbf7d0}.tag.warn{background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412;border-color:#fed7aa}.tag.bad{background:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;border-color:#fecaca}.tag.mid{background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;border-color:#c7d2fe}.rec-pill{display:inline-flex;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;padding:5px 8px;font-weight:900;white-space:nowrap}.muted{color:var(--muted)}.nowrap{white-space:nowrap}.small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.detail-panel{position:sticky;top:22px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden;max-height:calc(100vh - 44px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:190px}.detail-toggle{position:absolute;right:10px;top:10px;z-index:5;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:#334155;border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(15,23,42,.08)}.detail-panel.collapsed{width:58px;min-height:190px;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.detail-panel.collapsed .detail-head,.detail-panel.collapsed .detail-body{display:none}.detail-panel.collapsed .detail-toggle{top:12px;right:8px;writing-mode:vertical-rl;padding:10px 7px}.detail-panel.collapsed::after{content:'캐릭터 상세';writing-mode:vertical-rl;text-orientation:mixed;color:#64748b;font-weight:1000;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-top:44px}.detail-head{padding:18px 18px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffffff,#f8f7ff)}.detail-head h3{font-size:25px;margin:0}.detail-head p{margin:4px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}.detail-body{padding:16px;overflow:auto}.section{margin-bottom:18px}.section h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#334155}.kv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:94px 1fr;gap:6px 10px;font-size:13px}.kv b{color:#475569}.note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px;margin-top:8px}.awakening-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px}.awakening-item{margin-top:0;white-space:pre-line}.statgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px}.statitem{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:9px}.statitem span{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:900}.statitem b{font-size:16px}.empty{padding:32px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
.formula-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px}.formula-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px}.formula-card h3{margin:0 0 8px}.formula-card p{margin:6px 0;color:#475569;line-height:1.55}.badge-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.badge-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:15px}.badge-card h3{margin:0}.badge-card small{color:var(--muted)}
.footer{margin-top:22px;color:var(--text);line-height:1.6;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px}.footer .source-line{font-size:20px;font-weight:900;color:var(--text);margin:0 0 8px}.footer .credit-line{font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#334155;margin:0 0 4px}.footer .creator-line{font-size:15px;font-weight:900;color:#334155;margin:0 0 8px}.footer .notice-line{font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.mobile-warning{display:none;background:#fff7ed;color:#9a3412;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:14px;padding:10px;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:13px}
@media(max-width:1180px){.app{grid-template-columns:1fr}.sidebar{position:relative;height:auto;border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.workspace,.workspace.detail-collapsed{grid-template-columns:1fr}.detail-panel{position:relative;top:0;max-height:none}.detail-panel.collapsed{width:auto;min-height:54px}.detail-panel.collapsed .detail-toggle{writing-mode:horizontal-tb;right:10px;top:9px}.detail-panel.collapsed::after{writing-mode:horizontal-tb;margin:0 0 0 16px}.toolbar{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.badge-list{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.mobile-warning{display:block}.table-wrap{max-height:none}}
@media(max-width:720px){.main{padding:14px}.topbar{display:block}.toolbar{grid-template-columns:1fr}.formula-grid,.badge-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.data-table{min-width:980px}.sidebar{padding:16px}.workspace{gap:12px}}

.tier-note{background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;color:#9a3412;border-radius:16px;padding:13px 14px;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.55;font-weight:700}
.tier-layout{display:grid;gap:18px}
.tier-role-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}
.tier-role-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eef2ff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tier-role-head h3{margin:0;font-size:20px}
.tier-role-head span{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:900}
.tier-head-note{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:13px;color:#92400e;font-weight:1000;white-space:normal;line-height:1.35}
.tier-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px 1fr;min-height:92px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.tier-row:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.tier-rank{display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:1000;font-size:21px;color:#fff;background:#334155}
.tier-rank.god{background:#7f1d1d}.tier-rank.t0{background:#7c2d12}.tier-rank.t05{background:#a16207}.tier-rank.t1{background:#0369a1}.tier-rank.t2{background:#475569}.tier-rank.t3{background:#64748b}
.tier-members{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:12px}
.tier-token{width:92px;min-height:86px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8fafc;border-radius:16px;display:grid;grid-template-rows:44px auto;place-items:center;gap:6px;padding:8px;cursor:pointer;transition:.12s transform,.12s box-shadow,.12s border-color;position:relative}
.tier-token:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(15,23,42,.10);border-color:#818cf8}
.tier-token.selected{outline:3px solid rgba(79,70,229,.22);border-color:#4f46e5}
.tier-avatar{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:13px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e0e7ff,#f5f3ff);border:1px solid #c7d2fe;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:1000;color:#4338ca}
.tier-token-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:900;text-align:center;line-height:1.2;max-width:78px;word-break:keep-all}
.tier-token small{position:absolute;right:6px;top:5px;font-size:10px;color:#b45309;font-weight:1000;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:999px;padding:1px 5px}
.tier-detail-title{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px}
@media (min-width:1400px){.tier-layout{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}


.tier-server-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}
.tier-server-btn{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer;color:#334155}
.tier-server-btn.active{background:#111827;color:#fff;border-color:#111827}
.tier-server-desc{margin:0 0 12px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800}
.tier-avatar{overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.tier-avatar img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.tier-avatar span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:100%}
.tier-rank.unranked{background:#f1f5f9;color:#334155}
.tier-break-tabs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:8px;width:100%;margin:8px 0 14px}
.tier-break-btn{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:10px 12px;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer;color:#334155;font-size:13px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap}
.tier-break-btn.active{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;border-color:#4f46e5}
.tier-layout>.tier-break-tabs,.tier-layout>.kr-tier-wrap,.tier-layout>.tier-note{grid-column:1/-1;align-self:start}
.kr-tier-wrap{width:100%;overflow-x:auto}
.kr-tier-card{min-width:920px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}
.kr-tier-title{padding:14px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#eef2ff);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:20px;font-weight:1000}
.kr-tier-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:82px repeat(4,minmax(200px,1fr))}
.kr-tier-head{display:grid;place-items:center;min-height:54px;padding:10px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#f8fafc;color:#334155;font-weight:1000;font-size:16px}
.kr-tier-head:nth-child(5){border-right:0}
.kr-tier-grid>.tier-rank{min-height:112px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.kr-tier-members{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;align-content:center;min-height:112px;padding:12px;border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.kr-tier-members:nth-child(5n){border-right:0}
.kr-tier-grid>*:nth-last-child(-n+5){border-bottom:0}
.tier-note{margin:14px 0 0}
.tier-empty{background:#fff;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:20px;padding:22px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800;line-height:1.6}
.tier-role-note{margin:10px 16px 0;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;border-radius:14px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:1000;line-height:1.45}
.tier-token-note{font-size:10px;font-weight:1000;color:#9a3412;background:#fff7ed;border:1px solid #fed7aa;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 6px;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;max-width:82px}

/* Gacha simulator */
.gacha-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(320px,420px) minmax(520px,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:start}
.gacha-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);padding:16px}
.gacha-card h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:18px}.gacha-card p{margin:6px 0;color:#475569;line-height:1.55}.gacha-rule-help{margin-top:14px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#f8fafc}.gacha-rule-help h4{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;color:#0f172a}.gacha-rule-help p{margin:5px 0;color:#334155}
.gacha-form{display:grid;gap:10px}.gacha-field{display:grid;gap:6px}.gacha-field label{font-size:12px;color:#64748b;font-weight:1000}
.gacha-field input[type=number],.gacha-field select{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;padding:10px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:800}
.gacha-checks{display:grid;gap:8px;margin:4px 0}.gacha-checks label{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:#334155}
.gacha-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:8px}.gacha-actions .btn{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:10px 13px;background:var(--primary);color:#fff;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer}.gacha-actions .btn.secondary{background:#f1f5f9;color:#334155;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.gacha-state-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(120px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}.gacha-state{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:11px}.gacha-state b{display:block;font-size:22px}.gacha-state span{display:block;color:#64748b;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}
.gacha-result-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(108px,1fr));gap:10px;min-height:120px}.gacha-result{position:relative;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:10px;background:#f8fafc;min-height:132px;display:grid;align-content:start;gap:6px;overflow:hidden}.gacha-result.star1{background:#f8fafc;border-color:#94a3b8}.gacha-result.star2{background:#eff6ff;border-color:#3b82f6}.gacha-result.star3{background:#f5f3ff;border-color:#8b5cf6}.gacha-result.star4{background:#fefce8;border-color:#eab308}.gacha-result.star5{background:#fff7ed;border-color:#f97316}
.gacha-result.star1 .gacha-stars{color:#64748b}.gacha-result.star2 .gacha-stars{color:#1d4ed8}.gacha-result.star3 .gacha-stars{color:#6d28d9}.gacha-result.star4 .gacha-stars{color:#a16207}.gacha-result.star5 .gacha-stars{color:#c2410c}.char-thumb.rarity-1,.detail-portrait.rarity-1,.gacha-img.rarity-1,.tier-avatar.rarity-1{border:3px solid #94a3b8}.char-thumb.rarity-2,.detail-portrait.rarity-2,.gacha-img.rarity-2,.tier-avatar.rarity-2{border:3px solid #3b82f6}.char-thumb.rarity-3,.detail-portrait.rarity-3,.gacha-img.rarity-3,.tier-avatar.rarity-3{border:3px solid #8b5cf6}.char-thumb.rarity-4,.detail-portrait.rarity-4,.gacha-img.rarity-4,.tier-avatar.rarity-4{border:3px solid #eab308}.char-thumb.rarity-5,.detail-portrait.rarity-5,.gacha-img.rarity-5,.tier-avatar.rarity-5{border:3px solid #f97316}.char-thumb.rarity-unknown,.detail-portrait.rarity-unknown,.gacha-img.rarity-unknown,.tier-avatar.rarity-unknown{border:1px solid var(--line)}.gacha-result .gacha-stars{font-size:12px;font-weight:1000;color:#92400e}.gacha-result .gacha-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:1000;line-height:1.2}.gacha-result .gacha-small{font-size:11px;color:#64748b;font-weight:800}.pickup-badge{display:inline-block;background:#db2777;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;padding:2px 7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:1000}.gacha-img{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:13px;background:#e2e8f0;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(15,23,42,.08)}.gacha-img img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.gacha-img span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:100%;height:100%;font-weight:1000;color:#64748b}
.gacha-sim-output{margin-top:12px}.gacha-summary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.gacha-summary .gacha-state b{font-size:20px}.gacha-table{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;margin-top:10px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:14px}.gacha-table th,.gacha-table td{padding:9px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;font-size:13px}.gacha-table th{background:#f8fafc;color:#475569;font-weight:1000}.gacha-empty{display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;border-radius:16px;color:#64748b;font-weight:900;min-height:120px;background:#fff}
@media(max-width:1100px){.gacha-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.gacha-state-grid,.gacha-summary{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}


.skill-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(132px,1fr));gap:12px}.skill-gallery-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;background:#fff;padding:14px 10px;display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:8px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:var(--shadow);color:inherit}.skill-gallery-card:hover,.skill-gallery-card.selected{border-color:#6366f1;transform:translateY(-2px)}.skill-gallery-card .detail-portrait{width:84px;height:84px;border-radius:20px}.skill-gallery-card strong{font-size:15px}.skill-gallery-card>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}.skill-level-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;padding:12px;margin-top:10px}.skill-level-buttons{display:flex;gap:7px;margin:8px 0}.skill-level-btn{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer}.skill-level-btn.active{background:#4f46e5;color:#fff}.skill-level-btn.awaken-level{background:#fff7ed;border-color:#fdba74;color:#9a3412}.skill-level-btn.awaken-level.active{background:#ea580c;color:#fff}.skill-level-btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}.skill-level-data{margin-top:8px;padding:10px;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:12px}.skill-level-data p{margin:6px 0}.unlock-label{margin-left:8px;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 7px;background:#ffedd5;color:#9a3412;font-weight:900}.material-list,.awakening-skill-list{display:grid;gap:8px}.material-row,.awakening-skill-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:125px 1fr;gap:10px;padding:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc;font-size:12px}.material-pill{display:inline-flex;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:#eef2ff;color:#3730a3;font-weight:900}.awakening-skill-row span{white-space:pre-line;line-height:1.5}@media(max-width:720px){.skill-gallery{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.material-row,.awakening-skill-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

.workspace.skill-page-mode{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
.workspace.skill-page-mode #detailPanel{display:none}
.skill-full-page{position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:1000;overflow:auto;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7f8ff 0,#eef1f7 34%,#e9edf5 100%);padding:24px}
.skill-full-toolbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto 14px;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:var(--shadow);font-weight:1000}
.skill-full-toolbar button{border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#4f46e5;color:#fff;padding:10px 14px;font-weight:1000;cursor:pointer}
.skill-full-card{max-width:1060px;margin:0 auto 40px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;background:#fff;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}
.skill-full-card .detail-head{padding:22px 24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff,#f8f7ff)}
.skill-full-card .detail-body{padding:24px;overflow:visible}
.skill-full-card .detail-head-grid{grid-template-columns:120px 1fr}.skill-full-card .detail-portrait{width:120px;height:120px}
.skill-detail-open{overflow:hidden}
@media(max-width:720px){.skill-full-page{padding:10px}.skill-full-card .detail-body{padding:14px}.skill-full-card .detail-head{padding:16px}.skill-full-card .detail-head-grid{grid-template-columns:84px 1fr}.skill-full-card .detail-portrait{width:84px;height:84px}.skill-full-toolbar{border-radius:12px}.skill-full-toolbar span{font-size:12px}}
.selected-skill-level{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}.selected-skill-level>b{font-size:14px;color:#312e81}.skill-rate-value{font-size:14px!important;margin:9px 0!important}.skill-rate-value strong{font-size:20px;color:#4f46e5}.skill-cost-line{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.skill-cost-line>b{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
.skill-level-description{white-space:normal}.description-level-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:9px;padding-bottom:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.description-level-head>b{font-size:14px;color:#312e81}.description-copy{white-space:pre-line;line-height:1.65}.skill-material-data{margin-top:8px;padding:9px 10px;border-radius:12px;background:#f8fafc}.skill-material-data .skill-cost-line{padding-top:0;border-top:0}.skill-rate-value,.selected-skill-level{display:none!important}
.material-icons{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 14px;align-items:center;margin-top:7px}.material-icon-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;min-height:42px;color:#334155}.material-icon-frame{flex:0 0 42px;width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #dbe3ee;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#eef2f7);box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(15,23,42,.08);overflow:hidden}.material-icon-frame img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;display:block}.material-icon-frame img.is-missing{display:none}.material-icon-fallback{display:none;width:100%;height:100%;place-items:center;padding:3px;text-align:center;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;word-break:break-all;color:#64748b}.material-icon-frame img.is-missing+.material-icon-fallback{display:grid}.material-icon-text{font-size:13px;font-weight:1000;line-height:1.4;white-space:nowrap}.material-pill{display:none!important}@media(max-width:720px){.material-icons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:7px}.material-icon-frame{flex-basis:38px;width:38px;height:38px}.material-icon-text{white-space:normal}}

.base-illustration-button{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:100%;padding:18px 12px 38px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:18px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 35%,#fff 0%,#eff0f9 75%);cursor:zoom-in;overflow:hidden}
.base-illustration-button img{display:block;width:100%;height:480px;object-fit:contain;filter:drop-shadow(0 12px 16px #26334d24)}
.base-illustration-button span{position:absolute;bottom:12px;font-size:12px;color:#64748b}
.base-illustration-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #6366f1;outline-offset:3px}
.base-illustration-dialog{width:min(1000px,94vw);max-width:94vw;max-height:94dvh;padding:16px;border:1px solid #dfe4ef;border-radius:20px;background:#f4f5fb;color:#1e293b}
.base-illustration-dialog::backdrop{background:#101828bb}
.base-illustration-dialog form{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;margin-bottom:12px}
.base-illustration-dialog button{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 14px;background:#4f46e5;color:white;cursor:pointer}
.base-illustration-dialog>img{display:block;width:100%;height:calc(88dvh - 80px);object-fit:contain}
@media(max-width:600px){.base-illustration-button img{height:380px}.base-illustration-dialog{padding:12px}.base-illustration-dialog form{font-size:14px}}

</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
 <aside class="sidebar">
  <div class="logo"><div class="mark"></div><div><h1>ELPISOUL<br>캐릭터 DB</h1><small>PC 캐릭터 DB</small></div></div>
  <div class="side-note">한국 서버 클라이언트 기준 캐릭터 DB.</div>
  <div class="nav">
   <button class="tab active" data-tab="badge">배지 추천표</button>
   <button class="tab" data-tab="skill">스킬·스탯표</button>
   <button class="tab" data-tab="tier-cn">티어표(중섭)</button>
   <button class="tab" data-tab="tier-kr">티어표(한섭)</button>
   <button class="tab" data-tab="gacha">가챠 시뮬레이터</button>
   <button class="tab" data-tab="formula">공식·배지표</button>
  </div>
  <div class="stats">
   <div class="stat"><b id="totalCount">0</b><span>등록 캐릭터</span></div>
   <div class="stat"><b id="verifiedCount">0</b><span>상세 입력</span></div>
   <div class="stat"><b id="unreleasedCount">0</b><span>미출시</span></div>
   <div class="stat"><b id="shownCount">0</b><span>현재 표시</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="legend">
   <h3>검수상태</h3>
   <div class="legend-item"><span class="dot ok"></span>원문 확인 / 상세 입력</div>
   <div class="legend-item"><span class="dot mid"></span>요약 수집 / 역할별 확정</div>
   <div class="legend-item"><span class="dot warn"></span>임시공식 / 상황별</div>
   <div class="legend-item"><span class="dot bad"></span>미확인 / 미입력</div>
  </div>
 </aside>

 <main class="main">
  <div class="mobile-warning">PC 넓은 화면 기준. 폰에서는 표가 가로로 길어서 스크롤해서 보면 됨.</div>
  <div class="topbar">
   <div><h2 id="pageTitle">배지 추천표</h2><p id="pageDesc">캐릭터별 배지 추천, 깃털 옵션/부옵, 출처 상태 확인.</p><p id="pageUpdated" class="update-stamp">마지막 업데이트: 2026.09.03</p></div>
   <div class="actions"><label class="release-check"><input type="checkbox" id="hideUnreleased"> 미출시 제외</label><label class="release-check"><input type="checkbox" id="onlyUnreleased"> 미출시만 보기</label><button class="btn secondary" id="resetBtn">필터 초기화</button></div>
  </div>

  <div class="workspace">
   <div class="leftcol">
    <section class="panel active" id="panel-badge">
     <div class="toolbar">
      <input id="badgeSearch" placeholder="캐릭터/중국명/별칭/역할군/배지/유틸리티 검색">
      <select id="badgeJob"><option value="">직업 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeBadge"><option value="">배지 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeRarity"><option value="">성급 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeRoleGroup"><option value="">역할군 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeUtility"><option value="">전체태그 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeStatus"><option value="">상태 전체</option></select>
      <select id="badgeElement"><option value="">속성 전체</option></select>
     </div>
     <div class="table-card"><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table" id="badgeTable"></table></div></div>
     <div style="padding:12px 4px 0;text-align:right"><a href="https://gall.dcinside.com/mgallery/board/view/?id=erpis&amp;no=13557&amp;page=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:#4f46e5;font-weight:900;text-decoration:none">[배지 추천 자료 참고 - 에르피스갤러리]</a></div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="panel-skill">
     <div class="toolbar">
      <input id="skillSearch" placeholder="캐릭터/중국명/별칭/역할군/리더스킬/스킬/유틸리티 검색">
      <select id="skillJob"><option value="">직업 전체</option></select>
      <select id="skillRoleGroup"><option value="">역할군 전체</option></select>
      <select id="skillUtility"><option value="">전체태그 전체</option></select>
      <select id="skillDetail"><option value="">상세 전체</option><option value="yes">상세 입력만</option><option value="no">미입력만</option></select>
      <select id="skillElement"><option value="">속성 전체</option></select>
      <select id="skillStatus"><option value="">상태 전체</option></select>
     </div>
     <div id="skillGallery" class="skill-gallery"></div>
    </section>


    <section class="panel" id="panel-tier">
     <div class="tier-server-desc" id="tierServerDesc"></div>
     <div class="tier-layout" id="tierBoard"></div>
    </section>


    <section class="panel" id="panel-gacha">
     <div class="gacha-grid">
      <div class="gacha-card">
       <h3>가챠 설정</h3>
       <p>한국 서버 출시 캐릭터기준</p>
       <div class="gacha-form">
        <div class="gacha-field"><label>모드</label><select id="gachaMode"><option value="pickup">픽업 모집</option><option value="free">자유 모집</option></select></div>
        <div class="gacha-field gacha-pickup-field"><label>5성 픽업</label><select id="gachaPickup5"></select></div>
        <div class="gacha-field gacha-pickup-field"><label>4성 확률업 캐릭터</label><select id="gachaPickup4"><option value="">4성 확률업 없음</option></select></div>
        <div class="gacha-field"><label>현재 5성 천장 카운트 / 65</label><input id="gachaPity" type="number" min="0" max="64" value="0"></div>
        <div class="gacha-checks">
         <label><input type="checkbox" id="gachaGuarantee5"> 다음 5성 픽업 확정 상태</label>
        </div>
        <div class="gacha-actions">
         <button class="btn" id="gachaSingleBtn">1회 모집</button>
         <button class="btn" id="gachaTenBtn">10회 모집</button>
         <button class="btn secondary" id="gachaResetBtn">가챠 초기화</button>
        </div>
       </div>
      </div>
      <div class="gacha-card">
       <h3>모집 결과</h3>
       <div class="gacha-state-grid" id="gachaStateBox"></div>
       <div class="gacha-result-grid" id="gachaResults"><div class="gacha-empty">아직 모집 결과 없음</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gacha-card">
       <h3>픽업 5성 획득 시뮬레이션</h3>
       <p>선택한 픽업 5성을 얻을 때까지 필요한 모집 수를 여러 번 돌려 평균/중앙값/90% 지점을 계산함.</p>
       <div class="gacha-form">
        <div class="gacha-field"><label>시뮬레이션 횟수</label><input id="gachaSimRuns" type="number" min="1" max="100000" step="100" value="10000" placeholder="예: 10000"></div>
        <div class="gacha-field"><label>비용 기준</label><select id="gachaPackage"></select></div>
        <div class="gacha-actions"><button class="btn" id="gachaSimBtn">시뮬레이션 실행</button></div>
       </div>
       <div class="gacha-sim-output" id="gachaSimOutput"><div class="gacha-empty">시뮬레이션 실행 전</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="gacha-card">
       <h3>적용 규칙</h3>
       <p>기본 확률: 5성 2%, 4성 10%, 3성 30%, 1~2성 58%.</p>
       <p>5성 천장: 65회. 10회 모집에서 4성 이상이 없으면 10번째 결과를 4성으로 교체.</p>
       <p>5성 픽업 개런티: 비픽업 5성 획득 후 다음 5성은 픽업 확정.</p>
       <p>한정 캐릭터는 특정 한정 캐릭터 픽업에서만 획득 가능. 선택한 한정 픽업 외의 다른 한정 캐릭터는 획득 불가.</p>
       <p>4성 확률업: 특정 4성은 확률업 대상일 뿐, 다음 10회 모집에서 확정 보장은 없음.</p>
       <p>별빛: 같은 캐릭터를 중복 획득하면 성급과 획득 횟수에 따라 별빛을 누적.</p>
       <div class="gacha-rule-help">
        <h4>픽업 5성 획득 시뮬레이션</h4>
        <p><b>평균 뽑기 수</b>: 픽업 5성 뽑기까지 평균 횟수</p>
        <p><b>중앙값</b>: N번 돌렸을 때 절반은 이 숫자 안에 먹고, 절반은 이 숫자보다 더 걸렸다는 의미.</p>
        <p><b>90백분위수</b>: 10명 중 9명은 이 뽑기 수 안에 픽업 5성을 먹는다는 의미.</p>
        <p><b>예상 비용</b>: 평균 뽑기 수 × 선택한 패키지의 1뽑 가격</p>
       </div>
      </div>
     </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="panel-formula">
     <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card"><h3>딜러 기본 공식</h3><p><b>총공/궁극기 딜러</b>: 불꽃의 빛. 깃털은 치명타/치명타 피해 중심.</p><p><b>평타 딜러</b>: 용맹의 투지. 공격력%, 치명타, 치명타 피해, 공격속도 우선.</p><p><b>전투스킬 딜러</b>: 광폭의 심장. 전투스킬 비중이 높을수록 우선.</p></div>
      <div class="formula-card"><h3>탱커·힐러·보조 공식</h3><p><b>탱커</b>: 대지의 가호 또는 불굴의 영령. 깃털 막기 확률, 부옵 생명/방어/막기.</p><p><b>힐러</b>: 소생의 서약. 치료효과·공격속도·생존 부옵.</p><p><b>보조</b>: 인도의 이정표 / 비색의 계약 / 정적의 서곡 등. 세트 효과와 생존을 우선.</p></div>
     </div>
     <h2 style="margin:22px 0 12px">배지 번역표</h2>
     <div class="badge-list" id="badgeList"></div>
    </section>
   </div>

   <aside class="detail-panel" id="detailPanel">
    <button class="detail-toggle" id="detailToggle" aria-expanded="true" title="상세정보 접기">접기</button>
    <div class="detail-head"><h3>캐릭터 선택</h3><p>왼쪽 표에서 행을 클릭하면 상세 정보가 뜸.</p></div>
    <div class="detail-body"><div class="empty"></div></div>
   </aside>
  </div>
  <div class="footer"><p class="source-line">※ 참고자료 : GameKee, tap tap, 에르피스갤러리</p><p class="credit-line">가챠시뮬레이션 및 일부이미지 제공 : Loxa Lovecarstone</p><p class="creator-line">제작자: 무끼</p><p class="notice-line">본 사이트는 에르피스의 비공식 팬 공략 사이트이며, 사이트에 사용된 모든 이미지 및 게임 리소스의 저작권은<br>(주)Neptune Company 및 KumoMi에 있습니다. 권리자의 요청이 있을 경우 본 사이트의 콘텐츠는 수정 또는 삭제될 수 있습니다.</p></div>
 </main>
